#ASSERT `the person responsible for notifying the birth` `a birth in a public hospital` EQUALS `the chief executive of the health service provider`
#ASSERT `the person responsible for notifying the birth` `a birth in a private hospital` EQUALS `the hospital's chief executive officer or general manager`
#ASSERT `the person responsible for notifying the birth` `a home birth with a midwife` EQUALS `the doctor or midwife caring for the mother`
#ASSERT `the person responsible for notifying the birth` `a stillbirth at home with a doctor` EQUALS `the doctor who examined the stillborn child`
#ASSERT `the person responsible for notifying the birth` `a home birth with no doctor or midwife` EQUALS `any person in attendance at the birth`

#ASSERT `one month after` (YMD 2030 12 15) EQUALS YMD 2031 1 15
#ASSERT `one month after` (YMD 2031 1 31) EQUALS YMD 2031 2 28

#ASSERT `the number of days in the month after the birth` `a birth in a public hospital` EQUALS 30

#ASSERT NOT (`the responsible person commits an offence under s 12(2)` `a birth in a public hospital` `a notice on 5 October 2030`)
#ASSERT `the responsible person commits an offence under s 12(2)` `a birth in a public hospital` `a notice on 6 October 2030`
#ASSERT NOT (`the responsible person commits an offence under s 12(2)` `a birth in a public hospital` `a notice on 6 October 2030 by another person`)

