§ `s 13 -- when a birth must or may be registered`

`a birth overseas to a family moving to the State` MEANS Birth WITH
    `date of the birth` IS YMD 2030 9 5
    `in the State` IS FALSE
    `hospital involved` IS `no hospital`
    `a stillbirth` IS FALSE
    `a doctor or midwife in attendance` IS TRUE
    `registration ordered by a State court` IS FALSE
    `in an aircraft or on a vessel on the way to the State` IS FALSE
    `outside the Commonwealth, the child to become a resident of the State` IS TRUE
    `registered under a corresponding law` IS FALSE
    `a foundling` IS FALSE
    `a neonatal death` IS FALSE

`a birth overseas, already registered in another State` MEANS Birth WITH
    `date of the birth` IS YMD 2030 9 5
    `in the State` IS FALSE
    `hospital involved` IS `no hospital`
    `a stillbirth` IS FALSE
    `a doctor or midwife in attendance` IS TRUE
    `registration ordered by a State court` IS FALSE
    `in an aircraft or on a vessel on the way to the State` IS FALSE
    `outside the Commonwealth, the child to become a resident of the State` IS TRUE
    `registered under a corresponding law` IS TRUE
    `a foundling` IS FALSE
    `a neonatal death` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the birth must be registered` `a birth in a public hospital`
#ASSERT NOT (`the birth must be registered` `a birth overseas to a family moving to the State`)

#ASSERT `the birth may be registered under s 13(4) or (5)` `a birth overseas to a family moving to the State`
#ASSERT NOT (`the birth may be registered under s 13(4) or (5)` `a birth overseas, already registered in another State`)

